<h1 data-copy-en="Jinx" data-copy-zh="Jinx">Jinx</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Find each shift and follow personal milestones and equipment upgrades." data-copy-zh="找到各处班次，推进个人事件与装备升级。">Find each shift and follow personal milestones and equipment upgrades.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">去哪里找</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">卡住时检查什么</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Army_Recruitment_and_Supplies_Trades"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Two_One-Time_Dates"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Optional_Special_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Choose_the_Risk_2"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Choose_the_Risk"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="The_House_Always_Knows_2"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="The_House_Always_Knows"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Rules_of_the_Hustle_2"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Rules_of_the_Hustle"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Three_Heart-to-Hearts_and_Best_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Eleven_Automatic_Personal_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Talk_and_Negotiation_Lesson"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Recommended_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Jinx — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/jinx.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Jinx — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/jinx.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Jinx — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Jinx has a long personal scene chain, three conversations and two optional dates. Her later supplies shift, equipment upgrades and Army trades use different locations.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Exact_Locations_and_Day_Schedule"></span><h2>Where to find them</h2><p>Before The One Variable, find her at VOID Consumer Fulfillment Center, daily 12:00–01:59. Afterward, this portrait remains on odd days only; on even days she works at Supplies, 08:00–19:59.</p><p>Her personal conversations and dates start at the consumer center, not Supplies. Talk and Negotiation training are available at either scheduled workplace.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Later_Main-Story_Affection"></span><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Visit for The Hustle, then follow the automatic chain below. Story 34 is needed for Ghost in the Ledger, and again when continuing at Supplies for The One Variable. The three conversations progress separately in order; the dates are optional for the automatic chain.</p><p>Honest Walls is an independent Friend-stage visit at Unregistered Housing Complex. It is not a prerequisite for the main chain.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Automatic scene</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">The Hustle</th><td data-label="Location / start window">VOID Consumer Fulfillment Center; 12:00–23:59 / 00:00–01:59</td><td data-label="Requirements"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Honest Walls</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Unregistered Housing Complex</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">House Advantage</th><td data-label="Location / start window">VOID Consumer Fulfillment Center; 12:00–23:59 / 00:00–01:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Known (25); after The Hustle</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Honest Thief</th><td data-label="Location / start window">VOID Consumer Fulfillment Center; 12:00–23:59 / 00:00–01:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acquaintance (50); after House Advantage</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Perfect Miss</th><td data-label="Location / start window">VOID Consumer Fulfillment Center; 12:00–23:59 / 00:00–01:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100); after Honest Thief</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Harmless Rebellion</th><td data-label="Location / start window">VOID Consumer Fulfillment Center; 12:00–23:59 / 00:00–01:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100); after The Perfect Miss</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">No Free Variables</th><td data-label="Location / start window">VOID Consumer Fulfillment Center; 18:00–23:59 / 00:00–01:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Close Friend (200); after Harmless Rebellion</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Wrong Kind of Quiet</th><td data-label="Location / start window">VOID Consumer Fulfillment Center; 12:00–23:59 / 00:00–01:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Close Friend (200); after No Free Variables</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Ghost in the Ledger</th><td data-label="Location / start window">VOID Consumer Fulfillment Center; 18:00–23:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Close Friend (200); after The Wrong Kind of Quiet / Story 34</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Inventory Error</th><td data-label="Location / start window">VOID Consumer Fulfillment Center; 18:00–23:59 / 00:00–01:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Close Friend (200); after Ghost in the Ledger</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The One Variable</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Supplies; 08:00–21:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Close Friend (200); after Inventory Error / Story 34</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / start window</th><th scope="col">Cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Rules of the Hustle</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">VOID Consumer Fulfillment Center; Friend (100); after Honest Thief</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">75 min; 15 Energy; restores 5 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The House Always Knows</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">VOID Consumer Fulfillment Center; Close Friend (200); after The Wrong Kind of Quiet / Rules of the Hustle</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">90 min; 20 Energy; 10 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Choose the Risk</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">VOID Consumer Fulfillment Center; Crush (400); after Ghost in the Ledger / The House Always Knows</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">90 min; 20 Energy; restores 10 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The One Variable brings Jinx into the Army and changes her schedule. Its automatic visit is at Supplies, 08:00–21:59, after Inventory Error and Story 34 at Close Friend (200). This event window is wider than her later ordinary Supplies portrait shift.</p><p>At the consumer-center portrait, proficiency equipment upgrades are sequential: level 1→2 costs $1,000; 2→3 costs $5,000; 3→4 costs $10,000; 4→5 costs $25,000. Each takes 0 minutes, requires the preceding stored level and leaves the equipment’s kind unchanged. After her move, shop on an odd day.</p><p>Her three repeatable Army-item trades are at Supplies only, on her even-day shift. They take 0 minutes and spend Reclamation materials; use the Army guide’s exact recipes and effects.</p></section>
<section id="en-activities"><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / start window</th><th scope="col">Cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Jinx</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">VOID Consumer Fulfillment Center / Supplies; during the portrait schedule</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">15 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+1 base affection; 3/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Negotiation</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">VOID Consumer Fulfillment Center / Supplies; Known (25); Intelligence 16; content access indicated by the lock</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">180 min; $400; 40 Energy; 30 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+10 base affection; learn Negotiation once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Neon Bazaar Date</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">VOID Consumer Fulfillment Center; Friend (100); after Honest Thief; 16:00–21:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">120 min; $80; 30 Energy; restores 5 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Skygarden Date</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">VOID Consumer Fulfillment Center; Close Friend (200); after The Wrong Kind of Quiet; 12:00–15:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">120 min; $100; 30 Energy; restores 10 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Negotiation training needs Known (25), Intelligence 16, 180 minutes, $400, 40 Energy and 30 Calm, with the indicated content access. It teaches the skill once.</p><p>The Skygarden date’s reachable start is 12:00–15:59, because her consumer-center portrait begins at noon. After recruitment, use an odd day.</p><p>Favorite stats are Intelligence, Luck, Perception. The learned Sleight of Hand skill improves her relationship bonus.</p><p>Start times are shown; the ending hour is excluded. Base affection receives the relationship bonuses, while direct affection is added as listed. Ordinary affection, player Erotic Experience and NPC intimacy experience are separate.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Troubleshooting"></span><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><ul><li>For a personal conversation or date, use the consumer center on an odd day after recruitment.</li><li>For One Variable, visit Supplies during its event window, even before the ordinary portrait shift has been unlocked.</li><li>A proficiency upgrade needs the immediately preceding stored level; high affection does not permit skipping levels.</li><li>Army trades do not appear at the consumer-center shop.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-td-army.html">Army equipment recipes</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-reclamation-bay.html">Reclamation materials</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">Relationships and dates</a></li><li><a href="skills.html">Negotiation</a></li><li><a href="character-orchid.html">Orchid</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Army_Recruitment_and_Supplies_Trades"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Two_One-Time_Dates"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Optional_Special_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Choose_the_Risk_2"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Choose_the_Risk"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-The_House_Always_Knows_2"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-The_House_Always_Knows"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Rules_of_the_Hustle_2"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Rules_of_the_Hustle"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Three_Heart-to-Hearts_and_Best_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Eleven_Automatic_Personal_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Talk_and_Negotiation_Lesson"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Recommended_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Jinx 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/jinx.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Jinx 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/jinx.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Jinx 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Jinx有较长的个人事件链、三次交心对话与两次可选约会。后续补给班次、装备升级与军团交换分别位于不同地点。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Exact_Locations_and_Day_Schedule"></span><h2>去哪里找</h2><p>唯一变量之前，她每天12:00—01:59在VOID消费者履约中心。完成后这里只在单数日出现，双数日08:00—19:59改到补给库。</p><p>个人交心对话与约会从VOID消费者履约中心开始，不在补给库。交谈和谈判课程可在她当前的两个工作地点进行。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Later_Main-Story_Affection"></span><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>初次到访进行生存门道，之后按下表推进自动事件。账簿里的Ghost需要主线34，后续在补给库进行唯一变量也要求该主线完成。三次交心对话另外按顺序推进，两次约会不是自动事件链前置条件。</p><p>不说谎的墙是朋友阶段在未注册住宅区的独立到访，不是主链前置条件。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">自动事件</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">生存门道</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">VOID消费者履约中心；12:00–23:59／00:00–01:59</td><td data-label="条件"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">不说谎的墙</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">未注册住宅区</td><td data-label="条件">朋友（100）</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">庄家优势</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">VOID消费者履约中心；12:00–23:59／00:00–01:59</td><td data-label="条件">已知（25）；完成：生存门道</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">讲规矩的贼</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">VOID消费者履约中心；12:00–23:59／00:00–01:59</td><td data-label="条件">相识（50）；完成：庄家优势</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">完美的漏检</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">VOID消费者履约中心；12:00–23:59／00:00–01:59</td><td data-label="条件">朋友（100）；完成：讲规矩的贼</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">无害的反抗</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">VOID消费者履约中心；12:00–23:59／00:00–01:59</td><td data-label="条件">朋友（100）；完成：完美的漏检</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">没有自由变量</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">VOID消费者履约中心；18:00–23:59／00:00–01:59</td><td data-label="条件">亲密朋友（200）；完成：无害的反抗</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">不对劲的寂静</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">VOID消费者履约中心；12:00–23:59／00:00–01:59</td><td data-label="条件">亲密朋友（200）；完成：没有自由变量</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">账簿里的Ghost</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">VOID消费者履约中心；18:00–23:59</td><td data-label="条件">亲密朋友（200）；完成：不对劲的寂静、主线34</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">库存差错</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">VOID消费者履约中心；18:00–23:59／00:00–01:59</td><td data-label="条件">亲密朋友（200）；完成：账簿里的Ghost</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">唯一变量</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">补给库；08:00–21:59</td><td data-label="条件">亲密朋友（200）；完成：库存差错、主线34</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">街头规则（菜单：街头骗局规则）</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">VOID消费者履约中心；朋友（100）；完成：讲规矩的贼</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">75分钟；15精力；恢复5镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">庄家永远知道（菜单：庄家永远知道一切）</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">VOID消费者履约中心；亲密朋友（200）；完成：不对劲的寂静、街头规则</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">90分钟；20精力；10镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">选择风险</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">VOID消费者履约中心；迷恋（400）；完成：账簿里的Ghost、庄家永远知道</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">90分钟；20精力；恢复10镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr></tbody></table><p>唯一变量会使Jinx加入军团并改变班次：完成库存差错和主线34，达到亲密朋友（200），于08:00—21:59到补给库触发。此事件时段比之后的普通补给头像班次更长。</p><p>VOID消费者履约中心头像可逐级升级熟练度装备：1→2级$1,000，2→3级$5,000，3→4级$10,000，4→5级$25,000。均不消耗时间，要求紧邻的前一级储存等级，不改变装备种类。搬迁后请在单数日购买。</p><p>三种可重复的军团物品交换只在双数日补给班次提供，不消耗时间，以回收材料支付，准确配方与效果见军团指南。</p></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><h2>行动与奖励</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">和 Jinx 聊聊天</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">VOID消费者履约中心 / 补给库；头像出现时</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">15分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+1；每天3次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">谈判</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">VOID消费者履约中心 / 补给库；已知（25）；智力16；满足锁形提示所示的内容权限</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">180分钟；$400；40精力；30镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+10；学习谈判，仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">霓虹集市约会</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">VOID消费者履约中心；朋友（100）；完成：讲规矩的贼；16:00–21:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">120分钟；$80；30精力；恢复5镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">空中花园约会</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">VOID消费者履约中心；亲密朋友（200）；完成：不对劲的寂静；12:00–15:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">120分钟；$100；30精力；恢复10镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr></tbody></table><p>谈判课程要求已知（25）、智力16，花费180分钟、$400、40精力和30镇定，另需对应内容权限，技能只学习一次。</p><p>空中花园约会的实际开始时段为12:00—15:59，因为消费者履约中心头像中午才出现；招募后还需选择单数日。</p><p>偏好的属性为智力、运气、感知。学会巧手可提高关系加成。</p><p>表中均为开始时间，不包含结束整点。基础好感受关系加成影响，直接好感按所列数值增加。普通好感、玩家情趣经验和NPC亲密经验分别计算。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Troubleshooting"></span><h2>卡住时检查什么</h2><ul><li>招募后进行个人对话或约会，请在单数日去VOID消费者履约中心。</li><li>唯一变量要按事件时段到补给库，不必先等普通头像班次解锁。</li><li>装备升级需紧邻的前一级储存等级，好感不能用来跳级。</li><li>VOID消费者履约中心不提供军团物品交换，需到补给库。</li></ul></section>
